# Everything in this repo is consumed inside a Linux container: the Dockerfile,
# the firewall script, the compose files, the CI workflows. Force LF in the
# working tree on every platform so a Windows checkout cannot smuggle CRLF into
# an image. Without this, core.autocrlf=true rewrites files on checkout and a
# shell script arrives as `bad interpreter: /bin/bash^M`.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Belt and braces for the scripts specifically. This line is also mandatory in
# every consumer repo - see BLAST-CONTRACT.md.
*.sh text eol=lf
